      "rationale": "Withhold a maintenance visit for both trials. The PI requires the lower bound on North minus South delivery to exceed 1,000 L within a single trial. The POND-6 bounds are {{metric:gxa_01m8f6nv8tnv5zff3b:difference_low_L}} to {{metric:gxa_01m8f6nv8tnv5zff3b:difference_high_L}}, so North leads but the range straddles the dispatch threshold. The POND-7 bounds are {{metric:gxa_01m8f6sek4q866nmv4:difference_low_L}} to {{metric:gxa_01m8f6sek4q866nmv4:difference_high_L}}, so North leads and even the upper bound falls short. The completed custody register matches the POND-7 export digest, maps North to rack-B and South to rack-A, and confirms the original POND-6 assignment. The paired analyses cover both full trial windows and the reporting packet is complete."
